      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but what if the \"path\" is just more of the same? like, if i stay, i’m just gonna end up being another cautionary tale for them. another person who failed. sometimes it feels like the only way to actually protect them from seeing me fail like that... is to just not be part of the story anymore. to just stop the cycle before it gets to me.",
